00:00:58,370 --> 00:01:13,118
The Bell of Mirrors rang. Until that day, it stopped.

2
00:01:28,546 --> 00:01:57,470
In the mirror, a shadow woke before its master. I could only write it all down. At the crossroads, one path offers a promise.

3
00:01:57,890 --> 00:02:23,678
The other, the tide. Will your reflection choose for you? Dark Rock Legends, Abyssal Echoes, coming soon.

